---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: home
pageType: home
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Los Angeles mail art, one postcard at a time"
  description: "An archive of {{ groups.stats.artworks }} ArtCards by {{ groups.stats.artists }} artists from across Los Angeles County (2009–2015), organized by ZIP code and neighborhood. Formerly LA-Artist.com."
---
<section class="hero" data-hero data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Featured ArtCards" tabindex="0">
  <p class="hero-kicker">Featured Card</p>
  <div class="hero-stage">
    {% for a in homepage.hero %}
    <a class="hero-slide{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-hero-slide href="{{ ('/art/' + a.slug + '/') | url }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %} aria-hidden="{{ 'false' if loop.first else 'true' }}">
      <img
        src="{{ ('/assets/art/' + a.id + '.webp') | url }}"
        srcset="{{ ('/assets/art/' + a.id + '-400.webp') | url }} 400w, {{ ('/assets/art/' + a.id + '.webp') | url }} {{ a.w }}w"
        sizes="(max-width: 1200px) calc(100vw - 32px), 1168px"
        width="{{ a.w }}" height="{{ a.h }}"
        alt="ArtCard by {{ a.artist }}"
        data-hero-id="{{ a.id }}"
        {% if loop.first %}fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"{% else %}loading="lazy" decoding="async"{% endif %}>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
    <button class="hero-ctrl hero-prev" type="button" data-hero-prev aria-label="Previous ArtCard" hidden>‹</button>
    <button class="hero-ctrl hero-next" type="button" data-hero-next aria-label="Next ArtCard" hidden>›</button>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-bar">
    {%- for a in homepage.hero %}
    <p class="hero-cap"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %} data-hero-cap data-hero-slide-cap>
      <a href="{{ ('/art/' + a.slug + '/') | url }}">ArtCard by {{ a.artist }}</a>
      {%- if a.neighborhoods and a.neighborhoods[0] and a.neighborhoods[0].slug != 'japan' -%}
        <i> · <a href="{{ ('/neighborhood/' + a.neighborhoods[0].slug + '/') | url }}">{{ a.neighborhoods[0].name }}</a></i>
      {%- elif a.zips[0] -%}
        <i> · ZIP {{ a.zips | join(', ') }}</i>
      {%- endif %}
    </p>
    {%- endfor %}
    <div class="hero-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a featured ArtCard">
      {% for a in homepage.hero %}
      <button type="button" data-hero-dot role="tab" aria-label="ArtCard by {{ a.artist }}"{% if loop.first %} class="is-active" aria-current="true"{% endif %}></button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" data-hero-pool>{{ homepage.heroPool | dump | safe }}</script>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/hero.js' | url }}"></script>

<section class="intro">
  <h1>ArtCard: Los Angeles, one postcard at a time</h1>
  <p>From 2009 to 2015, volunteers left blank, pre-addressed postcards in coffee shops, galleries, libraries, community centers and schools across Los Angeles County. People turned each one into a free 4″ × 6″ canvas, wrote their name and ZIP code on the front, and mailed it back.</p>
  <p class="stats">{{ groups.stats.artworks }} ArtCards · {{ groups.stats.artists }} artists · {{ groups.stats.zips }} ZIP codes · {{ groups.stats.neighborhoods }} neighborhoods</p>
  <p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">Explore the map</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/zips/' | url }}">Browse by ZIP</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/artists/' | url }}">Artists A–Z</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/books/' | url }}">Books</a> <a class="btn ig" href="https://www.instagram.com/artcard.la/"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>Follow @artcard.la on Instagram</a></p>
</section>

<section class="mapwrap">
  <h2>Where the cards came from</h2>
  <div id="map" class="map" data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}" role="region" aria-label="Map of LA County ZIP codes shaded by number of ArtCards"></div>
  <p class="note">Darker ZIP codes sent in more cards. Tap a ZIP to see its cards. <a href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">Full-screen map</a></p>
</section>

<section class="classics">
  <h2>From the Classics</h2>
  <p class="note">A few earlier cards from the archive.</p>
  {% set items = homepage.classics %}{% set showZip = true %}{% include "grid.njk" %}
</section>

<section>
  <h2>From the collection <button class="shuffle" id="shuffle" type="button">Shuffle</button></h2>
  <div id="wall" data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}">
  {% set items = groups.art | take(30) %}{% include "grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-books" aria-labelledby="home-books-h">
  <div class="home-covers">
    <a href="{{ '/books/' | url }}"><img src="{{ '/assets/books/artcard-volume-1.webp' | url }}" width="401" height="401" alt=""></a>
    <a href="{{ '/books/' | url }}"><img src="{{ '/assets/books/artcard-volume-2.webp' | url }}" width="401" height="255" alt=""></a>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 id="home-books-h">Books</h2>
    <p>ArtCard Volume 1 and Volume 2, published in 2014, are still available in print and as a free digital edition on MagCloud.</p>
    <p class="cta" style="margin-top:10px"><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/books/' | url }}">See the books</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css' | url }}">
<script src="{{ '/assets/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js' | url }}"></script>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/map.js' | url }}"></script>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/wall.js' | url }}"></script>
